riend for doubles, while you look after your reputation and sponsors. A scenario editor lets you replay famous matches or build your own challenges.\n\nCustomization is a major draw in AO Tennis 2. An editing suite called the Academy builds your own player and courts, and you can also download creations from the community. Local and online multiplayer are supported, along with full controller support, making it a fit for tennis fans who like to compete with friends and tinker with content."}}